    "chunk_text": "IV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'05'29PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 29.05.20192A\n\nWESTERN PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nNotification made under Section 2(2) of the Entertainment Tax Ordinance No. 12 of 1946\n\nISURA DEVAPRIYA, Chief Minister of the Western Province and Minister of Finance and Planning, Engineering Services,Law and Order, Local Government and Provincial Administration,Economic Promotions, Power and Energy, Environmental Activities,Water Supply and Drainage and Tourism Activities.No. 204, Denzil Kobbekaduwa Mawatha,Battaramulla,Provinial Council Building,on this 18th day of April, 2019.\n\n06 - 316\n\nWESTERN PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nNotice published under Section 2(2) of the Entertainment Tax Ordinance No. 12 of 1946\n\nI, Isura Devapriya, the Chief Minister of Western Province and the Provincial Minister of Finance and Planning, EngineeringServices, Law and Order, Local Government and Provincial Administrations, Economic Promotion, Electricity and Power,Environmental Affairs, Water Supply and Drainage and Tourism Affairs, hereby give notice that by virtue of the powersvested in me under the provisions set out in Section 2 of the Provincial Council (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12of 1989 which should be read with Section 2(2) of the Entertainment Tax Ordinance No. 12 of 1946, approval is herebygranted to the proposal passed by the Seethawaka Pradeshiya Sabha on 10.10.2018 in terms of the provisions laid down inSection 2(1) of the Entertaiment Tax Ordinance No. 12 of 1946, to impose and charge 7.5% of the entrance fee to becharged from entertainment activities set out in the Entertainment Tax Ordinance No. 12 of 1946 as amended byEntertainment Tax (Amendment) Act No. 37 of 1984."
