    "description": "Ministry of Labour & Trade Union Relations - Collective Agreements entered into between Hatton National Bank PLC and Ceylon Bank Employees Union ; Housing Development Finance Corporation Bank  of Sri Lanka and Ceylon Bank Employees Union",
