    "chunk_text": "This Agreement shall supercede any other CollectiveAgreement entered into or binding on the parties heretoand such earlier Agreements shall stand repudiated inrespect of the parties hereto.\n\n4. Matters Covered and Bound\n\n(b) It is agreed by the parties covered and bound by thisAgreement that in relation to present employeesthey shall not during the continuance in force of thisagreement seek to vary, alter or add to all or any of\n\nthe terms and conditions of employment or benefitspresently applicable or enjoyed as provided for inthis agreement other than by mutual agreement.\n\n5. Consolidated Salary\n\nThe parties have agreed to consolidate the basic salaryand the fixed payment made in lieu of cost of livingallowance, to be included in the pay slips of employeesand thereafter continue as a consolidated salary witheffect from 1st April 2018. Accordingly, an employeecovered by this Agreement and in service as at the dateof this Agreement shall, from the 1st of April 2018 beplaced on the said new consolidated salary. Parties alsoagree that with effect from the date of this agreementthe starting consolidated salary for Bank Associates willbe Rs.61,000/- per month and will be applicable duringthe operational period of this collective agreement.\n\n6. Salaries\n\nFor the placement of an employee covered by thisagreement on the new consolidated salary with effectfrom 01.04.2018, the following provisions shall apply.\n\ni. A sum equal to 4% of the consolidated salary (Salaryplus fixed payment made in lieu of cost of livingallowance) payable to an employee as at 31st March2018 shall be added to the salary of an employee asat such time.\n\nii. Every employee in employment and covered by thisAgreement shall also receive a further 4% increasecalculated on the consolidated salary as at31.03.2019, with effect from 01.04.2019."
